Package: ssGSEA3
Title: Single-Sample and Site-Centric Gene Set Enrichment Analysis (ssGSEA/PTM-SEA)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Natalie", "Clark", , "nclark@broadinstitute.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Karsten", "Krug", role = "aut"),
    person("D R", "Mani", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Tools for gene-centric (ssGSEA) and site-centric (PTM-SEA)
    single-sample gene set enrichment analysis: GCT preprocessing into
    gene-centric or single-site-centric reports, a gene-level bootstrap
    enrichment/significance engine, and summary heatmap reporting with
    HALLMARK and PTMSigDB term groupings.
